</div><div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/Analytical_Chemistry/Supplemental_Modules_(Analytical_Chemistry)/Quantifying_Nature/Volumetric_Chemical_Analysis_(Shiundu)/14.1:_Sampling_and_Statistical_Analysis_of_Data" class="mt-section" id="section_6"><span id="List_of_relevant_resources"></span><h2 class="lt-chem-134629 editable">List of relevant resources</h2>

