<section class="box-example"><div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/Analytical_Chemistry/Supplemental_Modules_(Analytical_Chemistry)/Quantifying_Nature/Volumetric_Chemical_Analysis_(Shiundu)/14.1:_Sampling_and_Statistical_Analysis_of_Data" class="mt-section"><span id="Exercise_2:_2"></span><h5 class="box-legend lt-chem-134629 editable"><span class="lt-icon-default">Exercise 2:</span></h5>

<p class="lt-chem-134629">To how many significant figures ought the result of the operation (28.5 x 27) / 352.3 be reported and what is the calculated uncertainty?</p>
